    "title": "Futbol Now",
    "description": "Futbol Now is the ideal application for all those who love this passion. It allows us to follow all the football matches, so you don't miss any results.\r\n\r\nYou will be able to enjoy the best of football from your smartphone or tablet online, whether they are those corresponding to the main leagues in the WORLD! A superior option so that you are informed in the place where you are regardless of what you are doing.\r\n\r\nTeams, results, positions, scorers and more. All in one place. Check the match schedule in your country's time (GMT-3 Argentina/Uruguay) and follow your favorite team on your device anytime, anywhere.",
